{"id":44979,"brand_id":228,"unique_id":"gBhJqeFAmgzPmkaG","content_key":"/p/stories","identifies_id":228,"identifies_type":"Brand","title":"The Power of Give Miami Day","data":{"blocks":[{"col_1":[{"max":128,"min":16,"val":16,"type":"spacer","uuid":"056ee36b-53b5-4aae-af4c-023d83758434"},{"type":"text","uuid":"c61c6d46-bc9b-40cd-b662-863d66ff1343","content":"\u003ch1 id=\"isPasted\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003eThe Exponential Power \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003eof Give Miami Day: \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003eFlexible dollars at work\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h1\u003e\u003cp data-pasted=\"true\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003eWhen you donate on Give Miami Day, the nonprofits you choose to support receive flexible dollars, meaning they can use the money in whatever way will have the most impact on their mission. \u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWant to see your dollars at work?\u003c/strong\u003e Below, read stories about how Give Miami Day enables our nonprofits to more nimbly respond to Miami\u0026rsquo;s needs.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"}],"col_2":[{"max":128,"min":16,"val":16,"type":"spacer","uuid":"f8da6d04-0a64-4aee-84d9-6c5a5195de76"},{"url":"https://imagecdn.mightycause.com/1f952a92-e252-4720-ae2a-e6c4410b5714/","type":"image","uuid":"1f952a92-e252-4720-ae2a-e6c4410b5714","scale":"scale-100","width":5640,"height":3765,"content":"GMD 2024  (555).jpg","new_tab":false,"alt_text":null,"link_url":null,"position":"center"}],"layout":"block_5","col_order":["col_1","col_2"],"spacer_top":{"max":128,"min":0,"val":32},"backgrounds":[],"spacer_bottom":{"max":128,"min":0,"val":32},"spacer_mobile":true,"background_type":"color","background_color":null,"background_solid":"#6a3ebd","background_opacity":0},{"col_1":[{"max":128,"min":16,"val":50,"type":"spacer","uuid":"3994ac88-8810-4c7b-acdd-0d0e4a01f0bf"},{"type":"text","uuid":"a7991213-a076-48cc-82ec-e2586a4da7a6","content":"\u003ch2 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUsing Give Miami Day Funds to Gain Staff\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e"}],"layout":"block_1","col_order":["col_1"],"spacer_top":{"max":128,"min":0,"val":0},"backgrounds":[],"spacer_bottom":{"max":128,"min":0,"val":0},"spacer_mobile":true,"background_type":"color","background_color":null,"background_solid":null,"background_opacity":0},{"col_1":[{"url":"https://imagecdn.mightycause.com/99ce253b-e5ed-4066-85b9-852c0625059b/","type":"image","uuid":"99ce253b-e5ed-4066-85b9-852c0625059b","scale":"scale-100","width":1600,"height":900,"content":"tempImage9EREJR.heic","new_tab":false,"alt_text":"Actors from Hued Songs in costume performing on stage","link_url":"https://www.givemiamiday.org/p/stories/huedsongs","position":"center"},{"type":"text","uuid":"652a6d88-f24a-45a0-9bca-e4fe482ce12d","content":"\u003ch3 id=\"isPasted\"\u003eHued Songs\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026ldquo;Give Miami Day funds all the things that are unsexy that other people don\u0026rsquo;t want to fund,\u0026rdquo; says Kunya Rowley, the founder of Hued Songs, a performance series that celebrates and explores Black culture through music, artists, and history. Unsexy, but no less significant: thanks to funds raised on Give Miami Day, Rowley was able to transition into the nonprofit\u0026rsquo;s first full-time employee last year.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e"},{"url":"https://www.givemiamiday.org/p/stories/huedsongs","type":"button","uuid":"728f3013-8df6-45d6-b1ed-6fce71c829d7","color":"#6a3ebd","style":"solid","content":"Read More","new_tab":false,"position":"left"},{"max":128,"min":16,"val":16,"type":"spacer","uuid":"a3b41385-7df7-464c-b35a-cf175f2bd3e3"}],"col_2":[{"url":"https://imagecdn.mightycause.com/50c3750f-d34d-40a0-b7cb-0bcf58a87389/","type":"image","uuid":"50c3750f-d34d-40a0-b7cb-0bcf58a87389","scale":"scale-100","width":1600,"height":900,"content":"tempImage38l7zR.heic","new_tab":false,"alt_text":"Participant from de Moya Foundation's programming celebrating 5 years of employment","link_url":"https://www.givemiamiday.org/p/stories/demoyafoundation","position":"center"},{"type":"text","uuid":"62004665-4ede-4598-8a6f-a8239011124b","content":"\u003ch3 id=\"isPasted\"\u003eThe de Moya Foundation\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eJorge de Moya, The de Moya Foundation\u0026rsquo;s marketing director, noted that there are an additional 40 eager job seekers on the organization\u0026rsquo;s waiting list in Miami-Dade. He says hiring another employment specialist is the foundation\u0026rsquo;s \u0026ldquo;biggest need.\u0026rdquo; According to de Moya, each specialist can serve 20 young adults, which would allow the foundation to cut its waiting list in half.\u003c/p\u003e"},{"url":"https://www.givemiamiday.org/p/stories/demoyafoundation","type":"button","uuid":"6bbaaba5-0f4f-4178-804e-f6f0cb90bf84","color":"#6a3ebd","style":"solid","content":"Read More","new_tab":false,"position":"left"},{"max":128,"min":16,"val":16,"type":"spacer","uuid":"9d071510-cb7d-4253-82c2-f712deacf663"}],"col_3":[{"url":"https://imagecdn.mightycause.com/f55b16b1-9688-432f-a73d-062174b0068b/","type":"image","uuid":"f55b16b1-9688-432f-a73d-062174b0068b","scale":"scale-100","width":1600,"height":900,"content":"tempImagexnuxbS.heic","new_tab":false,"alt_text":"Incarcerated participants from Exchange for Change's programs receiving certificates","link_url":"https://www.givemiamiday.org/p/stories/exchangeforchange","position":"center"},{"type":"text","uuid":"36007630-3850-405a-930c-92975e2e7373","content":"\u003ch3 id=\"isPasted\"\u003eExchange for Change\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eDollars raised on Give Miami Day help pay the salaries of their two-member staff, a team that the nonprofit is eager to expand. \u0026ldquo;We would be able to expand the program exponentially if we hire more staff because we\u0026rsquo;re so lean,\u0026rdquo; said Kathie Klarreich, Executive Director of Exchange for Change.\u003c/p\u003e"},{"url":"https://www.givemiamiday.org/p/stories/exchangeforchange","type":"button","uuid":"d2fb7d5b-e6b3-4f62-a484-cb7184e834a6","color":"#6a3ebd","style":"solid","content":"Read More","new_tab":false,"position":"left"},{"max":128,"min":16,"val":16,"type":"spacer","uuid":"6ae28b61-27ad-4e8b-bad7-fca489a32d78"}],"layout":"block_4","col_order":["col_1","col_2","col_3"],"spacer_top":{"max":128,"min":0,"val":0},"backgrounds":[],"spacer_bottom":{"max":128,"min":0,"val":0},"spacer_mobile":true,"background_type":"color","background_color":null,"background_solid":null,"background_opacity":0},{"col_1":[{"max":128,"min":16,"val":50,"type":"spacer","uuid":"2f100d84-3d17-451d-ba4a-67d5d92a0ed8"},{"type":"text","uuid":"5528f5cc-8378-4bf4-adc0-d40db998db72","content":"\u003ch2 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003eUsing Give Miami Day Funds to Expand Services\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e"}],"layout":"block_1","col_order":["col_1"],"spacer_top":{"max":128,"min":0,"val":0},"backgrounds":[],"spacer_bottom":{"max":128,"min":0,"val":0},"spacer_mobile":true,"background_type":"color","background_color":null,"background_solid":"#6a3ebd","background_opacity":0},{"col_1":[{"url":"https://imagecdn.mightycause.com/82c00460-62d3-4855-bb7f-8bcf6f730b5d/","type":"image","uuid":"82c00460-62d3-4855-bb7f-8bcf6f730b5d","scale":"scale-100","width":1600,"height":900,"content":"tempImage9EREJR.heic","new_tab":false,"alt_text":"Dogs enjoying a small pool at the Humane Society of Greater Miami","link_url":"https://www.givemiamiday.org/p/stories/humanesocietyofgreatermiami","position":"center"},{"type":"text","uuid":"7f7e2f65-f483-4756-a5bf-7f38f7504ac2","content":"\u003ch3 id=\"isPasted\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003eThe Humane Society of Greater Miami\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003eGive Miami Day dollars are directed to Humane Society of Greater Miami\u0026rsquo;s operating fund, where they help cover the costs of getting animals \u0026ldquo;as healthy as possible\u0026rdquo; ahead of a hopeful adoption. Deworming, vaccinating, spaying or neutering, and microchipping amounts to hundreds of dollars in care for each pet.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"},{"url":"https://www.givemiamiday.org/p/stories/humanesocietyofgreatermiami","size":"medium","type":"button","uuid":"b1fffecb-506d-4d5d-9b72-87b7c946479e","color":"#6a3ebd","shape":"rectangle","style":"solid","invert":true,"content":"Read More","new_tab":false,"position":"left"},{"max":128,"min":16,"val":16,"type":"spacer","uuid":"00085c14-af99-458f-a36e-1a594adde1bf"}],"col_2":[{"url":"https://imagecdn.mightycause.com/4ef5ffae-894f-42ba-920b-61d182a3c5ee/","type":"image","uuid":"4ef5ffae-894f-42ba-920b-61d182a3c5ee","scale":"scale-100","width":1600,"height":900,"content":"tempImage38l7zR.heic","new_tab":false,"alt_text":"Students learning in the Safe Schools South Florida programs","link_url":"https://www.givemiamiday.org/p/stories/safeschoolsSFL","position":"center"},{"type":"text","uuid":"bd945177-89bd-4bc2-bc1b-d1b7fd42164e","content":"\u003ch3 id=\"isPasted\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003eSafe Schools South Florida\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003eExecutive Director Scott Galvin credits Give Miami Day dollars with helping the organization dive heavily into digital programming, which included launching multiple queer youth-led video series and beefing up Safe Schools South Florida\u0026rsquo;s social media presence. That increased digital presence led to an influencer marketing partnership with Out of the Closet thrift stores and Florida SuperCon.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"},{"url":"https://www.givemiamiday.org/p/stories/safeschoolsSFL","size":"medium","type":"button","uuid":"8fc2d8ed-c122-48b8-9df3-7a768d4a1c98","color":"#6a3ebd","shape":"rectangle","style":"solid","invert":true,"content":"Read More","new_tab":false,"position":"left"},{"max":128,"min":16,"val":16,"type":"spacer","uuid":"3e389ea9-dc06-40ab-b544-85c84aa17c71"}],"col_3":[{"url":"https://imagecdn.mightycause.com/1faa9e8f-b9e6-43af-b906-f5dd109d3554/","type":"image","uuid":"1faa9e8f-b9e6-43af-b906-f5dd109d3554","scale":"scale-100","width":1600,"height":900,"content":"tempImagexnuxbS.heic","new_tab":false,"alt_text":"Students from an EatWell Exchange program celebrating their artwork","link_url":"https://www.givemiamiday.org/p/stories/eatwellexchange","position":"center"},{"type":"text","uuid":"2b9241bc-ded8-45db-9b73-4ec0c7f146e8","content":"\u003ch3 id=\"isPasted\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003eEatWell Exchange\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003eLiberty City-native Ashley Carter, RD LDN teaches residents of all ages in Miami-Dade\u0026#39;s food deserts how to eat healthy while still enjoying heritage recipes and signature dishes. EatWell Exchange\u0026rsquo;s Give Miami Day fundraising supports the purchase of food and supplies for cooking classes so that supplies like knives and cutting boards don\u0026rsquo;t have to be shared between students. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"},[{"url":"https://www.givemiamiday.org/p/stories/eatwellexchange","size":"medium","type":"button","uuid":"93667f06-ef63-4365-a512-16c743d4fc62","color":"#6a3ebd","shape":"rectangle","style":"solid","invert":true,"content":"Read More","new_tab":false,"position":"left"}],{"max":128,"min":16,"val":16,"type":"spacer","uuid":"dcdbd58d-7c98-4753-b001-1eff18530ce7"}],"layout":"block_4","col_order":["col_1","col_2","col_3"],"spacer_top":{"max":128,"min":0,"val":0},"backgrounds":[],"spacer_bottom":{"max":128,"min":0,"val":0},"spacer_mobile":true,"background_type":"color","background_color":null,"background_solid":"#6a3ebd","background_opacity":0},{"col_1":[{"max":128,"min":16,"val":50,"type":"spacer","uuid":"2e12c5d0-71a9-4571-a330-b541001aa957"},{"type":"text","uuid":"ad53dee3-c099-4c32-9fdf-ee18dae0b80e","content":"\u003ch2 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUsing Give Miami Day Funds to Gain More Space\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e"}],"layout":"block_1","col_order":["col_1"],"spacer_top":{"max":128,"min":0,"val":0},"backgrounds":[],"spacer_bottom":{"max":128,"min":0,"val":0},"spacer_mobile":true,"background_type":"color","background_color":null,"background_solid":null,"background_opacity":0},{"col_1":[{"url":"https://imagecdn.mightycause.com/ec63a2de-b6da-43e2-818f-d457c677453a/","type":"image","uuid":"ec63a2de-b6da-43e2-818f-d457c677453a","scale":"scale-100","width":1600,"height":900,"content":"tempImage9EREJR.heic","new_tab":false,"alt_text":"Participants from The WOW Center's programming showcasing their artwork","link_url":"https://www.givemiamiday.org/p/stories/wowcenter","position":"center"},{"type":"text","uuid":"1c618514-c758-4edd-9679-f901ba948c2e","content":"\u003ch3 id=\"isPasted\"\u003eThe WOW Center\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026ldquo;Give Miami Day has become an integral part of The WOW Center\u0026#39;s fundraising efforts,\u0026rdquo; said Mari Rey, Director of Development, who added that the center\u0026rsquo;s goal of raising $100,000 this year on Give Miami Day \u0026ldquo;reflects our growing needs, particularly as we expand programs and facilities to accommodate the increasing number of individuals we serve.\u0026rdquo;\u003c/p\u003e"},{"url":"https://www.givemiamiday.org/p/stories/wowcenter","type":"button","uuid":"95d2659d-764b-43c6-981b-b11505dadce6","color":"#6a3ebd","style":"solid","content":"Read More","new_tab":false,"position":"left"}],"col_2":[{"url":"https://imagecdn.mightycause.com/9272c025-ee14-42e7-9fb3-bd4c1dc93a07/","type":"image","uuid":"9272c025-ee14-42e7-9fb3-bd4c1dc93a07","scale":"scale-100","width":1600,"height":900,"content":"tempImage38l7zR.heic","new_tab":false,"alt_text":"Some of the many children benefitting from the Nora Sandigo Children Foundation programs","link_url":"https://www.givemiamiday.org/p/stories/norasandigochildrenfoundation","position":"center"},{"type":"text","uuid":"dc8ffef0-132e-40dc-b2ed-32a253c18e78","content":"\u003ch3 id=\"isPasted\"\u003eNora Sandigo Children Foundation \u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe Nora Sandigo Children Foundation offers weekly distributions of quality, nutritious food to families in need. \u0026ldquo;Because [Give Miami Day] money isn\u0026#39;t earmarked and we can use it for anything, the thing we want to use it most for is food,\u0026rdquo; explained Maryam Rafieifar, one of Sandigo\u0026rsquo;s volunteers.\u003c/p\u003e"},{"url":"https://www.givemiamiday.org/p/stories/norasandigochildrenfoundation","type":"button","uuid":"85f06f05-6a2f-4ea8-9b15-c82b6bb2f1cb","color":"#6a3ebd","style":"solid","content":"Read More","new_tab":false,"position":"left"}],"col_3":[{"url":"https://imagecdn.mightycause.com/c713fa9a-a309-4e39-932a-41b601cac59b/","type":"image","uuid":"c713fa9a-a309-4e39-932a-41b601cac59b","scale":"scale-100","width":1600,"height":900,"content":"tempImagexnuxbS.heic","new_tab":false,"alt_text":"Volunteers from Mothers Fighting for Justice holding a sign that reads \"We can end gun violence\"","link_url":"https://www.givemiamiday.org/p/stories/mothersfightingforjustice","position":"center"},{"type":"text","uuid":"51567ec4-61f3-4282-b345-0f313b6a97d1","content":"\u003ch3 id=\"isPasted\"\u003eMothers Fighting for Justice\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026ldquo;If I reach my goal of $20,000, I will relocate to a larger facility to be able to help more families,\u0026rdquo; explained Romania Dukes, founder of Mothers Fighting for Justice, who wants to relocate not only to a larger location, but a safer one, so that Mothers Fighting for Justice can provide a true refuge from gun violence.\u003c/p\u003e"},{"url":"https://www.givemiamiday.org/p/stories/mothersfightingforjustice","type":"button","uuid":"0750ee20-444e-4537-a82a-32e0a1bd24e8","color":"#6a3ebd","style":"solid","content":"Read More","new_tab":false,"position":"left"}],"layout":"block_4","col_order":["col_1","col_2","col_3"],"spacer_top":{"max":128,"min":0,"val":0},"backgrounds":[],"spacer_bottom":{"max":128,"min":0,"val":0},"spacer_mobile":true,"background_type":"color","background_color":null,"background_solid":null,"background_opacity":0}],"header":{"config":{"hide":false,"gradient":true,"textStyle":"light"}}},"version":22,"published_at":"2026-11-03T16:19:14.000-05:00","deleted_at":null,"redirect_type":null,"redirect_url":null,"updated_at":"2026-11-03T16:19:14.000-05:00","created_at":"2026-11-03T16:19:14.000-05:00","internal_ref_title":"GMD Storytelling","milestone_id":null,"giving_event_id":554,"is_fallback":false,"metadata_computed":{"description":"","og_title":"The Power of Give Miami Day","og_description":null,"og_image_url":"https://imagecdn.mightycause.com/38461e70-27b8-4d4b-b5b6-93a81c2353df/-/crop/400x209/0,91/-/preview/","og_image_uuid":"38461e70-27b8-4d4b-b5b6-93a81c2353df","og_image_width":400,"og_image_height":209,"relative_url":"/p/stories","seo_no_index":null,"schema_markup":null},"metadata_stored":null,"min_mc_created_at":null,"user_may_edit_content":false,"draft_present":false,"created_by":{"id":"idi7ff","name":"Sam Baste"},"updated_by":{"id":"lsri8f","name":"Nathan Moyer"},"milestone_info":null,"giving_event_info":{"name":"Give Miami Day 2025","key":"gmd25","perm_urn":"ge_554"},"brand_navigation_header":{"id":3227,"unique_id":"AhPFOYwXQA9-3q_b","title":"2026 Post-Reg Transition (Nov3)","milestone_id":null,"default":false,"published_at":"2026-11-03T15:22:01.000-05:00","version":2,"milestone_info":null,"brand_id":228,"type":"BrandNavigation::Header","internal_ref_title":null,"created_a